hadiths[46]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2091","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do naimatein hain jismein logon mein se bahut dhokay mein hain: Sehat aur fursat. (Bukhari: 6412)"
"2092","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mera kandha pakda aur farmaya: Duniya mein ho jaa goya tum ajnabi ho ya raasta guzarney walay. Jabke Ibn Umar kehtey they: Jab tum shaam karo to subah ka intezaar na karo. Aur jab tum subah karo to shaam ka intezaar na karo. Aur apni sehat mein se apni beemaari key liye lo. Aur apni zindagi mein se apni maut key liye. (Bukhari: 6416)"
"2093","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chaukor lakeer kheenchi. Aur darmiyaan mein lakeer khench uskey baahar. Aur chhoti lakeerein uski taraf jo darmiyaan mein hai uskey pehlu se jo darmiyaan mein hai. Aur farmaya: Ye insaan hai. Aur ye uski maut hai jo use gherey huey hai. Ya wo use gher chuki hai. Aur ye jo baahar hai uski ummeed hai. Aur ye chhoti lakeerein museebatein hain. Phir agar use ye khata karey to use ye kaat-ti hai. Aur agar use ye khata karey to use ye kaat-ti hai. (Bukhari: 6417)"
"2094","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne lakeerein khenchen aur farmaya: Ye insaan hai aur ye uski maut hai. Phir jabke wo aisa hai ke qareeb lakeer uskey paas aai. (Bukhari: 6418)"
"2095","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne aadmi ko uzr diya jiski maut peechey ki yahan tak ke use saath saal tak pahunchaya. (Bukhari: 6419)"
"2096","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Budhay ka dil do mein jawaan rehta hai: Duniya ki mohabbat aur lambi ummeed mein. (Bukhari: 6420)"
"2097","[AI-translation] Itbaan bin Maalik Ansaari se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Banda Qiyaamat key din na aaeyga jo (Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi) kehta hai jabke wo uskey sath Allah ka chehra chaahta hai magar Allah us par aag haraam karega. (Bukhari: 6422)"
"2098","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala farmaata hai: Merey momin bandey key liye merey paas badla nahi hai jab main duniya walon mein se uskey pyaarey ko qabz karun, phir wo sawaab giney, magar Jannat. (Bukhari: 6424)"
"2099","[AI-translation] Aslami Mirdaas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nek pehla phir pehla jaaengey. Aur bhoosa baaqi rahega jaisa jau ya khajoor ka bhoosa. Allah unki parwaah na karega. (Bukhari: 6434)"
"2100","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Kaash Aadam key betey key paas maal ki do waadiyaan hon to wo teesri talab karega. Aur Aadam key betey ka pet mitti key siwa nahi bharti. Aur Allah us par tauba karta hai jo tauba karey. (Bukhari: 6436)"
"2101","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein kaun hai jiska waaris ka maal usey apne maal se zyada mehboob ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham mein koi nahi magar uska maal use zyada mehboob hai. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak uska maal jo us ne aagey bheja. Aur uskey waaris ka maal jo us ne peechey rakkha. (Bukhari: 6442)"
"2102","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Maaldaari saamaan ki kasrat se nahi hai. Lekin maal daari dil ki maal daari hai. (Bukhari: 6446)"
"2103","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se bhi (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Aale Muhammad ko rozi dey! (Bukhari: 6460)"
"2104","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ko uska amal najaat na dega. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur tumhey bhi nahi Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Aur mujhey bhi nahi magar ye ke Allah mujhey rehmat se dhaanp ley. Seedhey raho aur qareeb raho! Aur subah jao aur shaam jao! Aur raat key hissay mein kuchh! Aur darmiyaan darmiyaan, pahunchogey! (Bukhari: 6463)"
"2105","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha gaya: Allah ko kaunsa amal sab se mehboob hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jo hamesha ho agarchey kam ho. (Bukhari: 6465)"
"2106","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak Allah ne rehmat ko paida kya jis din use paida kya, sau rehmaten. To apne paas ninyanbe rehmatein rakkhen aur apni makhlooq mein sab mein aik rehmat bhej. Phir agar kaafir jaaney jo Allah key paas rehmat mein se sab hai to wo Jannat se mayoos na ho. Aur agar momin jaaney jo Allah key paas azaab mein se sab hai to wo aag se aman mein na ho. (Bukhari: 6469)"
"2107","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo mujhey uski zamaanat dey jo uski daadhi key darmiyaan hai aur jo uski taangon key darmiyaan hai to main usey Jannat ki zamaanat dunga. (Bukhari: 6474). Shuraih Khuzaai se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey donon kaanon ne suna aur merey dil ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey yaad kya: Mehmaan nawaazi teen din hai, uska inaam. Kaha gaya: Uska inaam kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Din aur raat. Aur jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai wo apne mehmaan ki izzat karey. Aur jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai wo bhalai kahey ya khaamosh rahey. (6476). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"2108","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak banda Allah ki raza ki baat kehta hai jise wo parwaah nahi deta. Allah use uskey sath darjay buland karta hai. Aur beshak banda Allah key ghussay ki baat kehta hai jise wo parwaah nahi deta. Wo uskey sath Jahannum mein girta hai. (Bukhari: 6478)"
"2109","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri aur jo Allah ne mujhey bhej kar misaal us aadmi jaisi hai jo qaum key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Main ne lashkar ko apni aankhon se dekha hai. Aur beshak main nanga daraanay wala hun. To najaat najaat! To giroh ne uski itaat ki aur raat key aakhir mein aahista chaley aur najaat paaey. Aur giroh ne use jhutlaaya aur lashkar ne unhey subah paa liya aur unhey jad se kaat diya. (Bukhari: 6482)"
"2110","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aag khwaahishaat se dhaanpi gai hai. Aur Jannat naapasandeeda cheezon se dhaanpi gai hai. (Bukhari: 6487)"
"2111","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat tum mein se kisi key jootay key tasmay se zyada qareeb hai. Aur aag us jaisi hai. (Bukhari: 6488)"
"2112","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi usey dekhey jo us par maal aur shakal mein fazeelat diya gaya hai to use dekhna chaahiye jo us se neechey hai. (Bukhari: 6490)"
"2113","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai jismein wo apne Rab Azza wa Jall se riwayat kartey hain, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne nekiyaan aur buraaiyaan likhen. Phir use wazeh kya. Phir jo neki ka iraada karey aur use na karey to Allah use apne paas poori neki likhta hai. Phir agar wo uska iraada karey aur use karey to Allah use apne paas das nekiyaan saat sau guna tak, bahut guna tak likhta hai. Aur jo buraai ka iraada karey aur use na karey to Allah use apne paas poori neki likhta hai. Phir agar wo uska iraada karey aur use karey to Allah use aik buraai likhta hai. (Bukhari: 6491)"

"2114","[AI-translation] Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein do hadeesein bayan kein. Main ne un mein se aik dekhi hai aur main doosri ka intezaar kar raha hun. Aap ne hamein bayan kya: Ke amaanat aadmiyon key dilon ki jad mein naazil hui. Phir unhon-ne Quran se seekha, phir unhon-ne Sunnat se seekha. Aur Aap ne hamein uskey uthaaye jaaney key baarey mein bayan kya aur farmaya: Aadmi neend soyega aur amaanat uskey dil se qabz ki jaaeygi. To uska nishaan nishaan jaisa rahega. Phir wo neend soyega aur qabz ki jaaeygi. To uska nishaan chhaalay jaisa rahega. Jaisa angaara jo tum ne apne paon par ludhkaaya aur wo phoot pada. To tum use ubhra hua dekhtey ho jabke us mein kuchh nahi hai. To log subah lein dein karengey aur koi amaanat adaa karney wala na hoga. To kaha jaaeyga: Beshak fulaan key beton mein ameen aadmi hai. Aur aadmi se kaha jaaeyga: Wo kitna aqalmand hai aur kitna hoshiyaar hai aur kitna mazboot hai! Jabke uskey dil mein raai key daaney baraabar imaan nahi hai. Aur beshak mujh par zamaana aaya hai aur mujhey parwaah nahi thi ke main tum mein se kiskay sath be karta hun. Agar wo Musalman hota to uska Islam use merey paas wapas karta. Aur agar wo Eesaai hota to uska kaarinda use merey paas wapas karta. Lekin aaj main fulaan aur fulaan key siwa be na karunga. (Bukhari: 6497)"
"2115","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak log sau oonton jaisey hain. Tum un mein sawaari taqreeban nahi paaogey. (Bukhari: 6498)"
"2116","[AI-translation] Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo sunaayega Allah uskey sath sunaayega. Aur jo dikhaawa karega Allah uskey sath dikhaawa karega. (Bukhari: 6499)"
"2117","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne farmaya: Jo merey dost se dushmani rakkhey to main ne usey ladai ka elaan kar diya hai. Aur mera banda mujh se kisi cheez key sath qareeb nahi hota jo mujhey us se zyada mehboob ho jo main ne us par farz kya hai. Aur mera banda nawafil key sath mujh se qareeb hota rehta hai yahan tak ke main us se mohabbat rakhta hun. Phir jab main us se mohabbat rakhta hun to main uska kaan hota hun jiskay sath wo sunta hai. Aur uski aankh jiskay sath wo dekhta hai. Aur uska haath jiskay sath wo pakadta hai. Aur uska paon jiskay sath wo chalta hai. Aur agar wo mujh se maangey to main use zaroor dunga. Aur agar wo mujh se panaah maangey to main use zaroor panaah dunga. Aur main kisi cheez mein jo main karney wala hun utna taraddud nahi karta jitna momin ki jaan mein taraddud karta hun. Wo maut ko naapasand karta hai aur main usey takleef deney ko naapasand karta hun. (Bukhari: 6502)"
"2118","[AI-translation] Saamit key betey Ubaada (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo Allah se milney ko pasand karey Allah us se milney ko pasand karta hai. Aur jo Allah se milney ko naapasand karey Allah us se milney ko naapasand karta hai. Aisha ya Aapki baaz biwiyon ne kaha: Beshak ham maut ko naapasand kartay hain. Aap ne farmaya: Wo nahi hai. Lekin momin jab us par maut haazir hoti hai to use Allah ki raza aur uski izzat ki khushkhabri di jaati hai. To uskey saamney jo hai us se zyada mehboob usey kuchh nahi hai. To wo Allah se milney ko pasand karta hai aur Allah us se milney ko pasand karta hai. Aur beshak kaafir jab haazir hota hai to use Allah key azaab aur uski saza ki khushkhabri di jaati hai. To uskey saamney jo hai us se zyada naapasandeeda usey kuchh nahi hai. Wo Allah se milney ko naapasand karta hai aur Allah us se milney ko naapasand karta hai. (Bukhari: 6507)"
"2119","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Dehaat walon mein sakht mizaaj aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aatey aur Aap se poochhtey: Qiyaamat kab hai? To Aap un mein sab se chhotay ko dekhtey aur farmaatey: Agar ye jeeta raha to use budhaapa na pahunchega yahan tak ke tum par tumhaari Qiyaamat khadi ho. (Bukhari: 6511). Qataada key betey Rabee key betey Abu Qataada Ansaari se riwayat hai ke wo bayan kartey they: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas se janaaza guzra. To Aap ne farmaya: Aaraam paaney wala aur jis se aaraam paaya gaya. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aaraam paaney wala aur jis se aaraam paaya gaya kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Momin banda duniya ki mehnat aur uski takleef se Allah ki rehmat ki taraf aaraam paata hai. Aur faasiq banda jis se banday aur shehar aur darkht aur jaanwar aaraam paatey hain. (6512). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"2120","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zameen Qiyaamat key din aik roti hogi. Jabbaar use apne haath se palat-ta hai jaisa tum mein se koi safar mein apni roti palat-ta hai, Jannat walon key liye mehmaan nawaazi. To Yahood mein se aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: Rehman tum par barkat karey ae Abul Qaasim! Kya main tumhey Qiyaamat key din Jannat walon ki mehmaan nawaazi ki khabar na dun? Aap ne farmaya: Kyun nahi. Us ne kaha: Zameen aik roti hogi. Jaisa Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamaari taraf dekha, phir hansay yahan tak ke Aapki daadhein zaahir huin. Phir farmaya: Kya main tumhey unkey saalan ki khabar na dun? Us ne kaha: Unka saalan baalaam aur noon hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur ye kya hai? Us ne kaha: Bail aur machhli, un donon key jigar ki zyadti mein se sattar hazaar khaaengey. (Bukhari: 6520)"
"2121","[AI-translation] Saad key betey Sahl (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Log Qiyaamat key din safed surkh zameen par haankey jaaengey, khaalis roti jaisi. Sahl ne kaha, ya ghair ne: Us mein kisi key liye nishaan nahi hai. (Bukhari: 6521)"
"2122","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Log teen tareeqon par haankey jaaengey. Ragbat aur khauf walay. Aur do oont par. Aur teen oont par. Aur chaar oont par. Aur das oont par. Aur unkey baaqi ko aag haankegi. Wo unkey sath dopahar karegi jahaan wo kahengey. Aur unkey sath raat guzaaregi jahaan wo raat guzaarengey. Aur unkey sath subah karegi jahaan wo subah karengey. Aur unkey sath shaam karegi jahaan wo shaam karengey. (Bukhari: 6522)"
"2123","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum nange paon nange jism baghair khatna haankey jaaogey. Aisha ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mard aur auratein baaz baaz ko dekhengey? To Aap ne farmaya: Muamla us se zyada sakht hai ke unhey uski fikr ho. (Bukhari: 6527)"
"2124","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah ne farmaya: Log Qiyaamat key din paseena bahaayengey yahan tak ke unka paseena zameen mein sattar haath jaaeyga. Aur unhey lagaam dega yahan tak ke unkey kaanon tak pahunchega. (Bukhari: 6532)"
"2125","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Pehla jo logon key darmiyaan faisla kya jaaeyga khoonon key sath hai. (Bukhari: 6533)"
"2126","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Jannat waley Jannat ki taraf aur aag waley aag ki taraf ho jaaengey to maut laai jaaeygi yahan tak ke wo Jannat aur aag key darmiyaan rakkhi jaaeygi, phir zibah ki jaaeygi. Phir pukaarne wala pukaarega: Ae Jannat walon! Maut nahi hai. Aur ae aag walon! Maut nahi hai. To Jannat waley apni khushi par khushi badhaayengey. Aur aag waley apne gham par gham badhaayengey. (Bukhari: 6548)"
"2127","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Jannat walon se farmaaeyga: Ae Jannat walon! To wo kahengey: Haaazir hain ae hamaarey Rab aur khushnaseeb hain! To wo farmaaeyga: Kya tum raazi huey? To wo kahengey: Aur hamein kya hai ke ham raazi na hon jab tum ne hamein diya hai jo tum ne apni makhlooq mein se kisi ko nahi diya. To wo farmaaeyga: Main tumhey us se afzal dunga. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae merey Rab! Aur us se afzal kya cheez hai? To wo farmaaeyga: Main tum par apni raza utaarunga aur uskey baad tum par kabhi naraaz na hunga. (Bukhari: 6549)"
"2128","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Kaafir key donon kandhon key darmiyaan tez sawaar key teen din ka safar hai. (Bukhari: 6553)"
"2129","[AI-translation] Maalik key betey Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Qaum aag se niklegi jab unhey us mein se jalan chhu chuki hogi aur wo Jannat mein daakhil hongey. To Jannat waley unhey Jahannami kahengey. (Bukhari: 6559)"
"2130","[AI-translation] Basheer key betey Noman (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak Qiyaamat key din aag walon mein sab se halke azaab wala aadmi hai jiskay donon qadmon key talwon par do angaaray hain jinkay sabab uska dimaagh ubhlega jaisa handi aur suraahi ubhalti hai. (Bukhari: 6562)"
"2131","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi Jannat mein daakhil na hoga magar use aag mein uska thikaana dikhaaya jaaeyga agar wo bura karta taake wo shukr badhaaey. Aur koi aag mein daakhil na hoga magar use Jannat mein uska thikaana dikhaaya jaaeyga agar wo achha karta taake wo us par hasrat ho. (Bukhari: 6569). Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main aag walon mein sab se aakhir nikalney waley aur Jannat walon mein sab se aakhir daakhil honay waley ko jaanta hun. Aadmi jo aag se gira hua niklega. To Allah farmaaeyga: Jao aur Jannat mein daakhil ho! To wo uskey paas aayega aur usey khayaal aayega ke wo bhari hai. To wo wapas aayega aur kahega: Ae merey Rab! Main ne use bhari paai. To wo farmaaeyga: Jao aur Jannat mein daakhil ho! To wo uskey paas aayega aur usey khayaal aayega ke wo bhari hai. To wo wapas aayega aur kahega: Ae merey Rab! Main ne use bhari paai. To wo farmaaeyga: Jao aur Jannat mein daakhil ho! Beshak tumhaarey liye duniya jaisa aur uskey das guna hain, ya: Beshak tumhaarey liye duniya key das guna jaisa hai. To wo kahega: Tum mujh se mazaq kartey ho, ya: Tum mujh se hanstey ho, jabke tum Baadshah ho! To main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap hansay yahan tak ke Aapki daadhein zaahir huin. Jabke wo farmaatey they: Wo Jannat walon mein kam martabey wala hai. (6571). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"2132","[AI-translation] Amr key betey Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mera Hauz mahiney ka safar hai. Uska paani doodh se zyada safed hai aur uski khushbu musk se umda hai. Aur uskey pyaalay aasmaan key sitaaron jaisey hain. Jo us mein se peey wo kabhi pyaasa na hoga. (Bukhari: 6579)"
"2133","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tumhaarey saamney Hauz hai jaisa Jarba aur Azruh key darmiyaan hai. (Bukhari: 6577)"
"2134","[AI-translation] Maalik key betey Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak merey Hauz ki miqdaar jaisey Aila aur Yaman mein Sana key darmiyaan hai. Aur beshak us mein pyaalay aasmaan key sitaaron ki ginti jaisey hain. (Bukhari: 6580)"
"2135","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jabke main khada tha ke giroh aaya yahan tak ke jab main ne unhey pehchaana to merey aur unkey darmiyaan aadmi nikla aur us ne kaha: Aao! To main ne kaha: Kahaan? Us ne kaha: Aag ki taraf, Allah ki qasam! Main ne kaha: Aur unka muamla kya hai? Us ne kaha: Beshak wo tumhaarey baad apni aidiyon par ultey murtad ho gaey. Phir giroh aaya yahan tak ke jab main ne unhey pehchaana to merey aur unkey darmiyaan aadmi nikla aur us ne kaha: Aao! Main ne kaha: Kahaan? Us ne kaha: Aag ki taraf, Allah ki qasam! Main ne kaha: Unka muamla kya hai? Us ne kaha: Beshak wo tumhaarey baad apni aidiyon par ultey murtad ho gaey. To main nahi dekhta ke un mein se najaat paaeyga magar maweshiyon key haml jaisa. (Bukhari: 6587)"
"2136","[AI-translation] Wahb key betey Haaritha (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko suna jabke Aap ne Hauz ka zikr kya aur farmaya: Jaisa Madina aur Sana key darmiyaan hai. (Bukhari: 6591). Qadr ki kitaab."
